    "definition_raw": "Source Wilderness Origins pg. 12\nYour natural spells are significantly increased, enabling you to feed and heal others.\n\nPrerequisites: Con 15, character level 8th, ghoran, natural magic racial trait.\n\nBenefit: Once per week, you can cast heroes’ feast as a spell-like ability with a caster level equal to your character level. If you do so, you lose access to the spells normally granted by the natural magic racial trait for the next 48 hours.",
